  "description": "Hi Everyone!🤚✨ Get ready to embark on a journey of environmental empowerment and collective action! 🌿 HIMAHI Universitas Budi Luhur proudly present “ASEAN YOUTH ENVIRONMENTAL ACTION 2024” with the theme ‘Heat Up the Plans, Cool the Earth: Collaborative Southeast Asian Youths Action for Climate Change Mitigation’ It’s our chance to team up and fight climate change together!✊🌿 Let’s come together to increase awareness, empower ASEAN youth, and take concrete steps towards combating climate change and achieving the Sustainable Development Goals. 🗓 From June 27-29, 2024, we’re bringing together ASEAN youth, NGOs, activists, students, and anyone who cares about our planet. So mark your calendars, spread the word, and join us in writing the next chapter of environmental advocacy and action. Together, let’s pave the way for a more sustainable, resilient future. 🌱💫  #AYEA2024 #ClimateActionNow #himahibudiluhur #himahijaya #astraguna2024 #universitasbudiluhur #memakmurkanbumi #melestarikanalam #sejahterakanumat ",
